# CareNest Frontend Architecture (BitsPro)

All application code lives in **`/frontend`**. Do not create app source outside that folder.

## Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Framework | Next.js App Router — Server Components by default |
| Language | TypeScript `strict: true` — **zero `any`** |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS + `clsx` / `tailwind-merge` |
| Icons | Lucide React |
| Forms | React Hook Form + Zod |
| Server state | TanStack Query |
| Client state | Zustand |
| Motion | Framer Motion (layout, accordion, carousel) |
| Images | Cloudinary URLs via `next/image` |

## Directory layout (`frontend/src/`)

```
src/
├── app/                 # Routes & layouts only
│   ├── (auth)/
│   ├── (marketing)/     # Landing, FAQ, waitlist
│   ├── layout.tsx
│   └── globals.css
├── components/
│   ├── ui/              # Primitives (Button, Card, Input, Accordion)
│   └── shared/          # Header, Footer, Navbar
├── features/            # Domain modules
│   ├── waitlist/        # components, hooks, services, types
│   ├── verification/
│   └── faqs/
├── lib/                 # fetch/axios wrappers, utils
├── hooks/               # Global hooks
└── types/               # Global TS defs
```

Feature-based: domain logic stays under `features/[name]/`; pages stay thin.

## Responsive (mobile-first)

- Write base Tailwind for mobile; scale with `md:`, `lg:`, `xl:`.
- **Hero (lg+):** side-by-side layout; overlapping glassmorphism search card. **Mobile:** stack; full-width search.
- **Community cards:** `grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8`.

## Images & performance

- Always `next/image` with explicit `sizes`, aspect-ratio wrappers, `priority` on above-the-fold hero.
- Force WebP/AVIF in `next.config` (or `next.config.ts`).
- Source assets from **Cloudinary**; use Cloudinary URLs in the app (no local heavy photo dumps for production imagery).

## Workflow checklist (every change)

1. **Component first** — reuse `src/components/ui` before new DOM/primitives.
2. **Types** — no inline API response types; put schemas in `types/` or `features/[feature]/types`.
3. **a11y** — `focus-visible:ring-2`, correct ARIA, brand-safe contrast.
4. **Scope** — only touch `/frontend` unless explicitly asked otherwise.

## After every implementation

Update `.cursor/rules/implementation-log.mdc` before finishing (see that rule). Read it at the start of the next task so work is never duplicated or contradicted.
